title).localeCompare(String(b.data.title))).map((item) => (<a class="result-item xlwu3zi fb" href={"/blog/" + item.id}><p class="xh6i4ui">{item.data.product}</p><p class="xiaf8te">{item.data.cardTitle}</p></a><div class="empty-state x8hviis fb"><p class="x8dn5lj">No blog posts found. Try a different title.</p></div>))}</div></div><div class="xhqr2mt"><p class="xajxpqh">Popular Pages</p><p class="xuguhcc">Explore Vocom</p><p class="x7efv2t">Quick links to the pages people look for most.</p><div class="xdbsy78"><a class="xldkpc9 fb" href="/"><p class="xiaf8te">Home</p><p class="xwtxand">Vocom’s homepage: fiber, AI, and telecom services.</p></a><a class="xldkpc9 fb" href="/fiber-optic-cables"><p class="xiaf8te">Fiber Optic Cable</p><p class="xwtxand">Wholesale fiber optic cable, built to order.</p></a><a class="xldkpc9 fb" href="/vocom-ai"><p class="xiaf8te">Vocom AI</p><p class="xwtxand">Enterprise AI tools for coaching, security, and supply chain.</p></a><a class="xldkpc9 fb" href="/vocom-international"><p class="xiaf8te">Vocom International</p><p class="xwtxand">Global telecom services and connectivity.</p></a><a class="xldkpc9 fb" href="/about"><p class="xiaf8te">About Us</p><p class="xwtxand">Who we are and what we do.</p></a><a class="xldkpc9 fb" href="/contact-vocomai"><p class="xiaf8te">Request a Quote</p><p class="xwtxand">Get in touch with our team.</p></a><a class="xldkpc9 fb" href="/resources"><p class="xiaf8te">Resources</p><p class="xwtxand">Guides, docs, and partner resources.</p></a><a class="xldkpc9 fb" href="/blog"><p class="xiaf8te">Blog</p><p class="xwtxand">News, insights, and product updates.</p></a><a class="xldkpc9 fb" href="/vocom-ai-agents"><p class="xiaf8te">AI Agents</p><p class="xwtxand">Autonomous agents for enterprise operations.</p></a><a class="xldkpc9 fb" href="/pricing-vocomai"><p class="xiaf8te">Pricing</p><p class="xwtxand">Vocom AI pricing and plans.</p></a><a class="xldkpc9 fb" href="/fiber-optic-cable-catalog"><p class="xiaf8te">